Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.89,0:00:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ok, job's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're free to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How were you able to get to this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get what you're asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo tried stopping me,\Nso I had to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so impatient.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.99,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 28\N{\fs30\fscy150}Hidden Inventory 4
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.01,0:01:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The season of the day. What will\Nkeep the same for the season?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.12,0:01:31.13,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,1000)\pos(320,10)}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100}Hidden Inventory/Premature Death
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The season of four sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of the\Nnight. How many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be a much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the middle of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day. This day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's going to be a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you can get your smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why you are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:01:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been around forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,snake,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:03:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tombs of the star in the Forbidden\NVault use barriers that conceal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.31,0:03:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they can't place\Nguards at the entrances.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you know where the doors\Nare located, they're full of holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorcerers are busy\Nduring this time of year,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Jujutsu High is brimming\Nwith flyheads right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.99,0:03:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pure chaos outside of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.47,0:03:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since I have no cursed energy,\NI'm like the Invisible Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was one problem though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I wield a cursed tool\Nthe cursed energy from
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will stop me from\Nbeing an invisible man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more to this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See I keep a cursed spirit\Naround capable of storing objects
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that's where I usually\Nput my cursed tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means the cursed\Nenergy from the cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spirit should stop me from\Nbeing an invisible man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.83,0:03:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I make the cursed spirit small\Nenough to fit inside my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep it in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, the organs of the invisible\Nman are invisible too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I'm able to pass\Nthrough any barrier while
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still carrying all kinds\Nof cursed tools with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's also why I didn't use a\Ncursed tool when I first got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.97,0:04:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I couldn't execute a\Nsurprise attack on the Six Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be much of a surprise\Nif I wasn't invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.19,0:04:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have killed the\NStar Plasma vessel first,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.53,0:04:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the risk of the Six\NEyes seeing me was too -
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a heavenly pact, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know revealing info about your\Nabilities increases its strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.61,0:04:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just like for a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I want to know anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know which doors\Nled to the Tombs of the Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't leave even the\Nslightest residuals behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans leave plenty of\Ntraces aside from residuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like scents, footprints, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pact enhances all\Nfive of my senses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There should have been\Nanother woman on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't really care if she lived or died.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's lucky she might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I really think you should die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Rainbow Dragon has\Nthe toughest tide there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.19,0:06:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A potential apparition deploys\Na simple domain that enforces
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,non-violence on both of us\Nuntil I answer its question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh well I'll just come out and\Nsay it. You're not my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that's how it is huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey it's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,curse manipulation a\Ntechnique that lets me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,absorb cursed spirits\Nthat have surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and freely manipulate them if\Nthere's roughly a two great
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,difference in our levels i skip\Nmaking them submit and absorb them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unconditionally his cursed spirit\Nmay have a unique ability but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not that strong by itself i can absorb\Nit that'll lock down his armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can just brute force it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't cut you badly enough to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I would have killed\Nyou if you were a Shikigami user.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with curse manipulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no telling what\Nmight happen to the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cursed spirits you've\Nabsorbed after you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.09,0:08:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather avoid the\Nextra trouble if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the blessing of parentage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, even with that blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were both beaten by a monkey like\Nme who can't even use curse techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna live a long\Nlife, don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of blessings...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave him the name Megumi.
