Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The corpse of the Star\NPlasma Vessel, Riko Amanai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All four limbs intact, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
