Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll issue your payment as we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even throw in a bonus for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Founder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is not the Founder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it was a necessary expense,\Nbut you've already helped us a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd complain a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hired you for the assassination,\Nfully expecting it would fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our star religious group\Nwas founded in the Nara era,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:10:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when Tengen began preaching about the\Nmoral foundations of Jujutsu sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.69,0:10:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu society and religious corporations\Nare at complete odds with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That strain is what gave birth to\Nour modern star religious group,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Time Vessel Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is also why we have devoted\Nourselves to remaining non-sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu Sorcerers are granted\Nmany privileges above the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're still fundamentally\Nforbidden to lay hands on non-sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the time had finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time of the taboo\Nrecorded in our scriptures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our star religious group now\Nworships one absolute god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was time for our object of\Nworship to assimilate with that impurity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we just sat back and let\Nthe assimilation happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our association would\Ncrumble yet if we took
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excessive action jujutsu\Nsorcerers would crush us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we were truly desperate\Nto find an optimum
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,outcome and how did it\Nall turn out at first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we thought we were going to\Nlose everything and now we
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have it all a perfect reason\Nto loosen our purse strings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what if tengen goes on\Nto lose control it could
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very well turn out that\Nall of human society
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will crumble if we\Nshould perish along with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our star then that'll\Nbe all there is to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,referring
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to okinawa
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you said they helped us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah why didn't you kill the maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right then, you had every chance to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.19,0:11:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take her someplace far away and\Nthen kill her at some point?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I had a pretty good idea of\Nwhat you were planning at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the call that the relief\Nfrom the maid's successful rescue
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would wear him down more than\Nheighten tensions from failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you had an unfortunate\Ntendency to often ignore the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lines of communication and would\Nignore whatever I was planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it all worked out\Nin the end, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.17,0:12:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And stop running your mediator ragged.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why did they help in Okinawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to laugh at that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, you'd use a car to\Ntransport a captive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Public transportation obviously\Ncarries too many risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The president happens\Nto own a private jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, asking for help...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich people think on a\Ndifferent scale, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, let's go eat with their money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me to one of those restaurants\Nthat you use for clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, as if you're\Ngonna pick up the check for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I decided I'll\Nonly see you again for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we don't work together\Nagain, I guess I'll see you in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, it's been a\Nwhile, huh? Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm for real real i'm\Nstill alive and kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.81,0:13:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse Cursed Technique\Nexactly when you stabbed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me through the throat i\Ngave up on counterattacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And poured all my focus\Ninto the reverse curse
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,technique cursed energy\Nis negative energy while
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can enhance the body\Nit can't regenerate it so
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you multiply that negative\Nenergy against itself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To create positive\Nenergy that's the reverse
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,curse technique easier said\Nthan done i could never
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do that till now and I\Ncouldn't understand anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one something's off\Nhe's blabbing on and on
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.08,0:13:52.83,Italics,Toji,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's blabbing on and on...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:14:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he high but i finally grasped\Nit on the verge of death the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,true essence of cursed energy The\Nreason you're going to lose is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you didn't chop my head\Noff and because you didn't Use
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that cursed tool when you stabbed\Nme in the head i'm gonna lose
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.15,0:14:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our fight is just getting\Nstarted. Oh? Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that right you could be\Nright you're so right
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse technique reversal red
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No bones are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shockwave was an\Napplication of limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cursed Technique Reversal Red, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.73,0:15:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he poured the positive\Nenergy generated by the Reverse
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cursed Technique into the Limitless\NTechnique ingrained into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, the power to stop the neutral\Napplication of the Limitless Technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.85,0:15:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, the power to retract the amplified\Napplication of the Limitless Technique Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.87,0:15:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, the power to repel the\Nreversal of his Cursed Technique, Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of these things I can handle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, this is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amanai, I'm sorry, but I have to admit,\NI'm not even angry about you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bear no crutch against anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's just that the world feels so,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so wonderful right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throughout heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I alone am the honored one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The merit of having a\Ntechnique that's passed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down for generations is\Nhaving a user's manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The downside is information about\Nthe technique is easily leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a member of the\NZenin clan, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.23,0:17:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you know so much\Nabout the Limitless technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, even in the Gojo clan, only\Na scant few actually know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the Amplified and the Reversal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then smash together those two different\Ninfinities to create imaginary mass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imaginary Technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.91,0:17:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hollow Purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to do any work for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally I would have said that\Nand hightailed it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.49,0:18:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet the freshly awakened wielder of the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.81,0:18:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,limitless technique was\Nright before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was probably the strongest\Njujutsu sorcerer of the modern age.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to reject him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to bring him to his knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to take down the pinnacle of the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jujutsu world and the zenin\Nclan that rejected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.15,0:18:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've twisted myself into knots for so\Nlong, all to try justifying my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.41,0:18:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that was the moment I truly lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you had abandoned that pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you had chosen to live\Nwithout respecting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or anyone else for that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:19:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any last words\Nthat you would like to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.97,0:19:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two or three years from now, my kid\Nwill be sold off to the Zenin clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what you will with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,STM opponent, who is the guy named Soko?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl is in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants to listen to him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can be a man where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is so smart and can be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl is home and has a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the four days\Na day to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that they are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a family and I\Ndon't work here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a family, friends\Nand I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.67,0:22:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the people who love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're late, Suguru.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I guess you got here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, there are several Star\NReligious Group facilities in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.23,0:22:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you already saw Shoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.95,0:22:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she was able to heal me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.35,0:22:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling fine again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.09,0:22:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't change\Nanything here, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.73,0:22:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I screwed up pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the one at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.65,0:22:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.31,0:22:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suguru, should we kill these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.63,0:22:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way I am right now, I\Ndoubt I'd feel anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.79,0:22:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.43,0:22:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like they are\Nonly common believers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The masterminds who know about our\Nworld have probably fled already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.63,0:23:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unlike with the bounty, they won't\Nbe able to talk their way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.35,0:23:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The organization had\Nproblems to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.25,0:23:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be dissolved soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.83,0:23:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No point, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does there really need\Nto be any point to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.75,0:23:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very important that there is.\NEspecially for a jujutsu sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.99,0:23:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if whoever\Ncame up with the phrase,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.23,0:23:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a surprising side, thought\Nof people as cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.91,0:23:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if whoever came up with the insult,\Nshallow, thought of people as flat surfaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.69,0:23:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, premature death.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.92,0:23:54.84,Next_Ep_Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Premature Death
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.75,0:23:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, people always\Nhave two sides to them.

